:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJOWN/NEWOWN'.New owner (NEWOWN)
:P.The new owner for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJOWN/ASPDEV'.ASP device (ASPDEV)
:P.The auxiliary storage pool device the command works in&colon. the
system ASP and basic user ASPs, or an independent ASP group.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*SYSBAS:EPK.
:PD.The system ASP and the basic user ASPs.
:PT.:PK.*CURASPGRP:EPK.
:PD.The ASP group of the job's current thread.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJOWN/CUROWNAUT'.Current owner authority (CUROWNAUT)
:P.The current owner authority for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *REVOKE.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=CHGOBJPGP.Change Object Primary Group (CHGOBJPGP)
:P.Use the Change Object Primary Group (CHGOBJPGP) command to give an
object a new primary group.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJPGP/OBJ'.Object (OBJ)
:P.The object or objects the command works on, by name and library.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGOBJPGP/OBJTYPE'.Object type (OBJTYPE)
:P.The type or types of the objects the command works on.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
