:PT.:PK.*AUDIT:EPK.
:PD.Audit special authority.
:PT.:PK.*JOBCTL:EPK.
:PD.Job control special authority.
:PT.:PK.*SAVSYS:EPK.
:PD.Save system special authority.
:PT.:PK.*IOSYSCFG:EPK.
:PD.Input/output system configuration special authority.
:PT.:PK.*SECADM:EPK.
:PD.Security administrator.
:PT.:PK.*SERVICE:EPK.
:PD.Service.
:PT.:PK.*SPLCTL:EPK.
:PD.Spool control special authority.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *USRCLS.
:EHELP.
