:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PK.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/PWDEXPITV'.Password expiration interval (PWDEXPITV)
