:PD.No limit.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 3 digits. The value must be from 1 to 366.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/PWDCHGBLK'.Block password change (PWDCHGBLK)
