:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*SYSVAL:EPK.
:PD.The value of the system value that holds the default.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a number of up to 2 digits. The value must be from 1 to 99.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/LCLPWDMGT'.Local password management (LCLPWDMGT)
