:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/MAXSTG'.Maximum storage (K) (MAXSTG)
:P.The most auxiliary storage, in kilobytes, the user's objects may
occupy.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
