2147483647.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/PTYLMT'.Highest schedule priority (PTYLMT)
:P.The highest schedule priority for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PV.number:EPV.
:PD.Type a whole number. The value must be from 0 to 9.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/JOBD'.Job description (JOBD)
:P.The job description that supplies the job's attributes, by name and
library.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:EPARML.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Library&colon. the name can be qualified by it.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/GRPPRF'.Group profile (GRPPRF)
:P.The group profile for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
