:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/OWNER'.Owner of new objects (OWNER)
:P.The owner of the objects created.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*USRPRF:EPK.
:PD.The value of the user profile the job runs under.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *GRPPRF.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/GRPAUT'.Group authority (GRPAUT)
:P.The group authority for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*CHANGE:EPK.
:PD.Change authority&colon. all data authorities and operational
authority. The object can be used and its contents changed.
:PT.:PK.*USE:EPK.
:PD.Use authority&colon. the object can be read and run but not changed.
:PT.:PK.*EXCLUDE:EPK.
:PD.No authority&colon. the object cannot be used.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/GRPAUTTYP'.Group authority type (GRPAUTTYP)
:P.The group authority type for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*PRIVATE:EPK.
:PD.Private authorities.
:PT.:PK.*PGP:EPK.
:PD.The primary group.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/SUPGRPPRF'.Supplemental groups (SUPGRPPRF)
:P.The supplemental groups for this command.
:P.Up to 15 values can be given.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/ACGCDE'.Accounting code (ACGCDE)
:P.The accounting code the job's resources are charged to.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*BLANK:EPK.
:PD.Blanks&colon. no value.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 15 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/DOCPWD'.Document password (DOCPWD)
:P.The document password for this command.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 8 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='CHGUSRPRF/MSGQ'.Message queue (MSGQ)
:P.The message queue that receives the messages the command or the
object sends.
:P.The prompt shows this parameter after F10 (Additional parameters).
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*SAME:EPK.
:PD.The value does not change.
