:PT.:PK.*PRINT:EPK.
:PD.The output is printed with the job's spooled output.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=DSPUSRPRF.Display User Profile (DSPUSRPRF)
:P.Use the Display User Profile (DSPUSRPRF) command to show a user
profile, or one view of it into a file.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPUSRPRF/USRPRF'.User profile (USRPRF)
:P.The user profile the command uses.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='DSPUSRPRF/TYPE'.Type of information (TYPE)
:P.The type of information for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*BASIC:EPK.
:PD.Basic.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *CMDAUT, *DEVAUT, *OBJAUT, *OBJOWN, *OBJPGP,
*PGMADP, *UPGINF, *GRPMBR.
