:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=EDTAUTL.Edit Authorization List (EDTAUTL)
:P.Use the Edit Authorization List (EDTAUTL) command to edit the entries
of an authorization list on a screen.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='EDTAUTL/AUTL'.Authorization list (AUTL)
:P.The authorization list that secures the object.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
