:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='GRTOBJAUT/REFASPDEV'.Reference ASP device (REFASPDEV)
:P.The reference ASP device for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*SYSBAS:EPK.
:PD.The system ASP and the basic user ASPs.
:PT.:PK.*CURASPGRP:EPK.
:PD.The ASP group of the job's current thread.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:P.Also accepted&colon. *.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='GRTOBJAUT/REPLACE'.Replace authority (REPLACE)
:P.Whether an existing object of the same name is replaced. A replaced
object is moved to library QRPLOBJ when it is in use.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NO:EPK.
:PD.The command ends with a message when an object of the same name
exists.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.An existing object of the same name is replaced.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=GRTUSRAUT.Grant User Authority (GRTUSRAUT)
:P.Use the Grant User Authority (GRTUSRAUT) command to give a user every
private authority another user holds.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='GRTUSRAUT/USER'.User (USER)
:P.The user for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='GRTUSRAUT/REFUSER'.Reference user (REFUSER)
:P.The reference user for this command.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=PRTADPOBJ.Print Adopting Objects (PRTADPOBJ)
:P.Use the Print Adopting Objects (PRTADPOBJ) command to print the
programs that adopt the authority of a user.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTADPOBJ/USRPRF'.User profile (USRPRF)
:P.The user profile the command uses.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTADPOBJ/CHGRPTONLY'.Changed report only (CHGRPTONLY)
:P.Whether to changed report only.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*NO:EPK.
:PD.No.
:PT.:PK.*YES:EPK.
:PD.Yes.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=PRTJOBDAUT.Print Job Description Auth (PRTJOBDAUT)
:P.Use the Print Job Description Auth (PRTJOBDAUT) command to print the
job descriptions that name a user and are not excluded from the public.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTJOBDAUT/LIB'.Library (LIB)
:P.The library for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*ALLUSR:EPK.
:PD.Every user library&colon. libraries whose names do not start with Q,
and the Q libraries that hold user data (QGPL, QUSRSYS and the like).
:PT.:PK.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=PRTPUBAUT.Print Public Authorities (PRTPUBAUT)
:P.Use the Print Public Authorities (PRTPUBAUT) command to print the
objects of one type the public can use.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTPUBAUT/OBJTYPE'.Object type (OBJTYPE)
:P.The type or types of the objects the command works on.
:P.A value is required.
:PARML.
