:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTPUBAUT/LIB'.Library (LIB)
:P.The library for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ALL:EPK.
:PD.All of them.
:PT.:PK.*ALLUSR:EPK.
:PD.Every user library&colon. libraries whose names do not start with Q,
and the Q libraries that hold user data (QGPL, QUSRSYS and the like).
:PT.:PK.*LIBL:EPK.
:PD.The library list of the job is searched; the first match is used.
:PT.:PK.*CURLIB:EPK.
:PD.The current library of the job. When the job has none, QGPL is used.
:PT.:PV.name:EPV.
:PD.Type a name of up to 10 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTPUBAUT/FOLDER'.Folder (FOLDER)
:P.The folder for this command.
:PARML.
:PT.:PK DEF.*ANY:EPK.
:PD.Any value matches.
:PT.:PK.*NONE:EPK.
:PD.None.
:PT.:PV.character-value:EPV.
:PD.Type up to 63 characters.
:EPARML.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME=PRTPVTAUT.Print Private Authorities (PRTPVTAUT)
:P.Use the Print Private Authorities (PRTPVTAUT) command to print the
private authorities to objects of one type.
:EHELP.
:HELP NAME='PRTPVTAUT/OBJTYPE'.Object type (OBJTYPE)
:P.The type or types of the objects the command works on.
:P.A value is required.
